# 从多任务界面划掉也存盘（第二阶段 4a0710f，iOS）：只失活、没进后台就被结束——先失活、0.3 秒后终止回调（同 DM_TEST_TERM_AT 的顺序），终止前要等到存档提交
# Swiping away from the app switcher still saves (phase 2, 4a0710f, iOS): ended while only inactive, never in the background -- resign, then the termination callback 0.3 s later (the order of DM_TEST_TERM_AT); a save must commit before it ends
name swipe_away_saves
requires ios-mac device
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
stick 0 1 frames=30
app resign
sleep 0.3
system_quit
check saved
check no_red
check no_red_log
